{"d":"<div>&nbsp;Akustiskie sienas paneļi ir mūsdienīgs dizaina risinājums, kas pie&scaron;ķir Tavam interjeram unikālu un izsmalcinātu izskatu! Paneļu īpa&scaron;ais dizains ievērojami uzlabos tavas telpas akustiku un skaņas izolāciju.</div>\r\n<div xat24cr=\"\" x1mh8g0r=\"\" x1vvkbs=\"\" xtlvy1s=\"\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span xexx8yu=\"\" x4uap5=\"\" x18d9i69=\"\" xkhd6sd=\"\" x1hl2dhg=\"\" x16tdsg8=\"\" x1vvkbs=\"\" x3nfvp2=\"\" x1j61x8r=\"\" x1fcty0u=\"\" xdj266r=\"\" xat24cr=\"\" xgzva0m=\"\" xhhsvwb=\"\" xxymvpz=\"\" xlup9mm=\"\"><img height=\"16\" width=\"16\" alt=\"✅\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" /></span> Estētiska daudzveidība &ndash; uzstādi paneļus horizontāli vai vertikāli, pielāgo tos savam stilam un vēlmēm ar dažādām finierējuma krāsu un rakstu iespējām</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div xat24cr=\"\" x1mh8g0r=\"\" x1vvkbs=\"\" xtlvy1s=\"\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span xexx8yu=\"\" x4uap5=\"\" x18d9i69=\"\" xkhd6sd=\"\" x1hl2dhg=\"\" x16tdsg8=\"\" x1vvkbs=\"\" x3nfvp2=\"\" x1j61x8r=\"\" x1fcty0u=\"\" xdj266r=\"\" xat24cr=\"\" xgzva0m=\"\" xhhsvwb=\"\" xxymvpz=\"\" xlup9mm=\"\"><img height=\"16\" width=\"16\" alt=\"✅\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" /></span> Ideāla akustika &ndash; samazini skaņas atbalsi un uzlabo komfortu jebkurā telpā.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div xat24cr=\"\" x1mh8g0r=\"\" x1vvkbs=\"\" xtlvy1s=\"\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span xexx8yu=\"\" x4uap5=\"\" x18d9i69=\"\" xkhd6sd=\"\" x1hl2dhg=\"\" x16tdsg8=\"\" x1vvkbs=\"\" x3nfvp2=\"\" x1j61x8r=\"\" x1fcty0u=\"\" xdj266r=\"\" xat24cr=\"\" xgzva0m=\"\" xhhsvwb=\"\" xxymvpz=\"\" xlup9mm=\"\"><img height=\"16\" width=\"16\" alt=\"✅\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" /></span> Viegli un ērti &ndash; vienkār&scaron;a uzstādī&scaron;ana un transportē&